  "solution": "Given equation: 18 ÷ 3 + 12 × 6 – 4 = x\n\nBODMAS table:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLets check each option one by one\n\nOption 1) ‘+’ and ‘ – ‘ and ‘×’ and ‘÷’ \n\nGiven: 18 ÷ 3 + 12 × 6 – 4 = x\n\n__18 x 3 - 12 ÷ 6 + 4 __ = 48\n\n__18 x 3 - 2 + 4__*__ __*= 48\n\n__54 - 2 + 4__ = 48\n\n56 ≠ 48\n\nLHS≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) ‘+’ and ‘ – ‘ and ‘×’ and ‘÷’ \n\nGiven: 18 ÷ 3 + 12 × 6 – 4 = x\n\n__18 x 3 - 12 ÷ 6 + 4 __ = 38\n\n__18 x 3 - 2 + 4__*__ __*= 38\n\n__54 - 2 + 4__ = 38\n\n56 ≠ 38\n\nLHS≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) ‘+’ and ‘ – ‘ and ‘×’ and ‘÷’ \n\nGiven: 18 ÷ 3 + 12 × 6 – 4 = x\n\n**__18 x 3 - 12 ÷ 6 + 4 __** = 56\n\n**__18 x 3 - 2 + 4__***__ __*= 56\n\n**__54 - 2 + 4__** = 56\n\n**56 = 56**\n\nLHS = RHS\n\nOption 4) ‘+’ and ‘ – ‘ and ‘×’ and ‘÷’ \n\nGiven: 18 ÷ 3 + 12 × 6 – 4 = x\n\n__18 x 3 - 12 ÷ 6 + 4 __ = 42\n\n__18 x 3 - 2 + 4__*__ __*= 42\n\n__54 - 2 + 4__ = 42\n\n56 ≠ 42\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence the correct answer is**, \"Option 3\".**",
